Yeah, of course.

192
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:21,010
Although, don't you ever wonder what could have been?

193
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:22,110
What do you mean?

194
00:10:22,970 --> 00:10:27,950
Well, sometimes I think of how things could have turned out if I had done things a little differently.

195
00:10:28,650 --> 00:10:29,010
For example?

196
00:10:29,590 --> 00:10:35,350
Like, for example, if I hadn't studied architecture, I would have become an artist like I wanted to.

197
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:36,420
I see.

198
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:37,260
Yeah.

199
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:41,680
Now that I think of it, I wouldn't have gotten married if I hadn't moved to this town and met Sally.

200
00:10:42,420 --> 00:10:44,920
You see, everything happens for a reason.

201
00:10:45,420 --> 00:10:49,360
We wouldn't even have met if I hadn't been in that car accident 10 years ago.

202
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:51,260
Well, I have no regrets.

203
00:10:51,980 --> 00:10:52,660
I'll drink to that.

204
00:10:54,360 --> 00:11:01,400
All right, we're back.

205
00:11:01,430 --> 00:11:06,150
So, Catherine, any other regrets maybe in your life apart from opening your mouth?

206
00:11:06,490 --> 00:11:07,450
Any other regrets?

207
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:13,480
If my parents had spoken Spanish to me as a kid, I would have learned.

208
