225
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,190
She's fluent in German too.

226
00:11:57,290 --> 00:11:58,430
And I studied German at school.

227
00:11:58,850 --> 00:12:00,330
See, this is the interesting thing now.

228
00:12:00,520 --> 00:12:03,520
